{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>אשר על העדות</b> [which is upon the testimony]. A shortened form of ארון העדות [Ark of the Testimony]. Yefet said that יערוך [he shall arrange] is like כערכך הכהן (Leviticus 27:12) — that he shall arrange oil sufficient for the lamps to burn from evening to morning, and likewise נרות המערכה (below, 39:37). This is correct, for the reason of יערך is that the lamps are arranged in a half-circle; I will speak further on this."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:45.128187473Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}